TYPES.md §16, VIEWMODEL.md G23, G16 (log-2026-09-28 "check follow-ups 4 review"): `@menu`'s menu and its `icon:` resolve against project.studio without an import; a deprecated one is W3301 at that use. A name the studio does not declare (`ruby`) is views' E1610, silent here. (Both are a WORD, GRAMMAR.md `studio{Enum}`: a qualified form is syntax's E1119.)
-- studio/studio.canon --
package studio

/// Menus.
enum Menu {
  items
  old @deprecated("use items")
}

/// Icons.
enum Icon {
  gem
  gear @deprecated
}
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A gem.
record Gem {
  /// Its cut.
  cut: Int
}

/// The gems.
@menu(old, icon: gear)
let gems: [Gem] = []

/// The stones.
@menu(old, label: "Stones")
let stones: [Gem] = []

/// The rubies.
@menu(items, icon: ruby)
let rubies: [Gem] = []
